OL,4,BEFL Trophy holders Luton face Palace   
OL,5,BU21s in last 32                        
OL,6,GHolders Luton Town will host Crystal   
OL,7,GPalace Under-21s in the last 32 of the 
OL,8,GJersey Mike's Trophy.                  
OL,10,FThe Hatters, who beat Stockport County 
OL,11,F3-1 in last season's EFL Trophy final  
OL,12,Fat Wembley, won their group in the     
OL,13,Fopening stages of the competition,     
OL,14,Fcoming through their three matches     
OL,15,Funbeaten.                              
OL,17,FThree-time winners Peterborough United 
OL,18,Fhave been drawn away at Plymouth       
OL,19,FArgyle with Posh hoping to win the     
OL,20,Ftrophy for a record fourth time.       
